{"5449150":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Rally Rush","steam_appid":5449150,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally Rush is a top-down arcade rally game built for one more go. Hold the throttle, throw the car into each bend and stay clear of the barriers. Every stage is a flat-out sprint against the clock—where a tenth of a second can separate first place from fourth.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eight rallies. Eight distinct locations.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through forests, grasslands, snow-covered passes, mountains, deserts, city streets, coastal roads and dense jungle. Every location has its own surfaces, scenery, conditions and hazards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on over 60 stages, with runs lasting from around 45 seconds to two minutes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather and night<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master rain, snow, fog and dust storms. Race through dusk, then tackle night stages illuminated only by your headlights.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expect the unexpected<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid rockfalls, fallen logs, roadworks, parked trucks and other hazards. Charge across narrow bridges, jumps and river fords, through tunnels and along cliff roads high above the sea.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your co-driver calls every bend and warns you about the dangers ahead.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Championship<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on every rally in sequence and score points throughout the season. You have just three restarts to make them all count, with fourteen rivals competing in every rally.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Trial<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to any stage you have unlocked, chase your fastest time and race against your own ghost.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Daily and weekly events<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a new stage and rally every day, plus a longer event each week. Every player receives the same challenge, with worldwide leaderboards for every event.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seventeen cars. Your colours.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every car performs equally, so the leaderboard is decided by the driver. Win rallies to unlock more cars, choose your favourite and give it your own paint scheme.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyboard or controller<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with the keyboard or plug in a controller—the next run is always moments away.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally Rush is a top-down arcade rally game built for one more go. Hold the throttle, throw the car into each bend and stay clear of the barriers. Every stage is a flat-out sprint against the clock—where a tenth of a second can separate first place from fourth.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eight rallies. Eight distinct locations.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through forests, grasslands, snow-covered passes, mountains, deserts, city streets, coastal roads and dense jungle. Every location has its own surfaces, scenery, conditions and hazards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on over 60 stages, with runs lasting from around 45 seconds to two minutes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather and night<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master rain, snow, fog and dust storms. Race through dusk, then tackle night stages illuminated only by your headlights.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expect the unexpected<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid rockfalls, fallen logs, roadworks, parked trucks and other hazards. Charge across narrow bridges, jumps and river fords, through tunnels and along cliff roads high above the sea.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your co-driver calls every bend and warns you about the dangers ahead.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Championship<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on every rally in sequence and score points throughout the season. You have just three restarts to make them all count, with fourteen rivals competing in every rally.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Trial<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to any stage you have unlocked, chase your fastest time and race against your own ghost.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Daily and weekly events<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a new stage and rally every day, plus a longer event each week. Every player receives the same challenge, with worldwide leaderboards for every event.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seventeen cars. Your colours.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every car performs equally, so the leaderboard is decided by the driver. Win rallies to unlock more cars, choose your favourite and give it your own paint scheme.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyboard or controller<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with the keyboard or plug in a controller—the next run is always moments away.<\/p>","short_description":"A top-down arcade rally game built for one more go. Twelve rallies from forest and snow to a volcanic island and two race circuits, over 60 stages against the clock, a co-driver calling every bend, and new events every day.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5449150\/677bdb9d874c3e3c8f7f20f5ac12652d68de53d2\/header.jpg?t=1793725075","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5449150\/1578754399a42e3156d7ba677c0894ff38979039\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793725075","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5449150\/1578754399a42e3156d7ba677c0894ff38979039\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793725075","website":"https:\/\/games.studiobastion.com\/games\/rally-rush","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual core, 2 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 graphics with 1 GB (Intel UHD 620 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad core, 3 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 1050 or Radeon RX 560, 2 GB<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon, or Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-capable graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 13 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple Silicon graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Studio Bastion Games Co"],"publishers":["Studio Bastion Games Co"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":389,"final":350,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"3,89€","final_formatted":"3,50€"},"packages":[1880504],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Rally Rush"